    "group": "Chief Librarian Mephiston",
    "summary": "When the Movement phase of your opponent begins, this unit may use this level 2 psychic ability if it is free of Battle-shock, rolling one D6 as its psychic roll. A result of 1 leaves the unit Battle-shocked. Having rolled, each enemy unit no more than 6″ away that Falls Back takes a Leadership roll and, should it fail, is forced to Remain Stationary.",
